## Choosing a component

| To show | Component |
|------|------|
| A metric over time, with markers, thresholds and brushing | [TimeseriesChart](./timeseries-chart.en.mdc) |
| Training progress: runs and seeds compared over steps | [LearningCurve](./learning-curve.en.mdc) |
| Geographic distribution | [Maps](./maps.en.mdc) |
| Where traffic, budget or conversions flow | [SankeyChart](./sankey-chart.en.mdc) |
| Lines, areas, bars, scatter and arcs combined freely | [Custom Chart](./custom-chart.en.mdc) |
| Monochrome dashboard charts and an activity calendar | [MonoChart](./mono-chart.en.mdc) |
| Funnels, gauges, heatmaps, radars, treemaps and other types | [ECharts](./echart-charts.en.mdc) |
| Presentational charts with a dithered texture | [DitherChart](./dither-chart.en.mdc), in the [Motion suite](./motion-suite.en.mdc) |
| A trend, share, difference or strength within a line | [SparkChart](./spark-chart.en.mdc), [AllocationBar](./allocation-bar.en.mdc), [DiffTable](./diff-table.en.mdc), [SignalMeter](./signal-meter.en.mdc) |

## Overview

- Charts import from `@talex-touch/tuffex/charts` and the visualization components live in the main package; both ship through the `@talex-touch/tuffex/pro` entry.
- Everything except the ECharts charts renders with Vue (SVG, with Canvas for SparkChart and the dither layer) and never loads echarts; the ECharts charts load the optional `echarts` dependency when they mount.
- The native charts share the `--tx-chart-*` theme variables and `ChartPalette`, and follow the host's light and dark themes.
- The native charts animate on ECharts' default timings: 1000ms enter, 500ms data update, 300ms state switch; under `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` they land on the final frame.
